# Visual demo for the DIR_THROTTLE / 2.8 heading convention. Spawns four ships at the origin,
# each driven by a2x_dir_throttle at a cardinal 2.8 heading. Run with the GUI and watch them fan
# out from the centre station.
#
# IMPORTANT: a2x mirrors 2.8 coordinates (Cosmos = 100000 - x on X and Z). Directions mirror the
# SAME way so a ship still flies toward its (mirrored) 2.8 destination -- so 2.8 EAST correctly
# appears on SCREEN-LEFT in Cosmos, not screen-right. The EXPECTED Cosmos screen directions are:
#   heading 0   (2.8 North) -> screen UP
#   heading 90  (2.8 East)  -> screen LEFT     (mirror of East; NOT a bug)
#   heading 180 (2.8 South) -> screen DOWN
#   heading 270 (2.8 West)  -> screen RIGHT
# If a ship flies OTHER than its labelled screen direction, the dir_throttle signs are wrong.
# Slow throttle (0.4) keeps them on screen; open the Game Master console to watch the map.
#
# Run:  python -m cosmos_dev.mission_runner A2xTestRange --map heading_demo --gui

=== run_heading_demo
metadata: ``` yaml
type: demo/heading
```
    side_ensure("tsn", "TSN")
    # A player ship at the centre so you can get on a console (Science shows the tactical map;
    # it stays put with no orders, a fixed reference while the demo ships fan out around it).
    # Mirrors the server console's create_default_player_ships: spawn + default_player_ship role
    # + the create_player_ships signal, so console-select offers it.
    dh_obs = to_id(player_spawn(0, 0, 0, "Observer", "tsn", "tsn_battle_cruiser"))
    add_role(dh_obs, "default_player_ship")
    set_inventory_value(dh_obs, "respawn_time", 5)
    signal_emit("create_player_ships", None)
    # centre reference marker
    npc_spawn(0, 3000, 0, "ORIGIN", "tsn", "starbase_1", "behav_station")

    dh_n = npc_spawn(0, 0, 0, "hdg000_2p8N_screenUP", "tsn", "tsn_battle_cruiser", "behav_npcship")
    a2x_dir_throttle(dh_n, 0, 0.4)
    dh_e = npc_spawn(0, 0, 0, "hdg090_2p8E_screenLEFT", "tsn", "tsn_battle_cruiser", "behav_npcship")
    a2x_dir_throttle(dh_e, 90, 0.4)
    dh_s = npc_spawn(0, 0, 0, "hdg180_2p8S_screenDOWN", "tsn", "tsn_battle_cruiser", "behav_npcship")
    a2x_dir_throttle(dh_s, 180, 0.4)
    dh_w = npc_spawn(0, 0, 0, "hdg270_2p8W_screenRIGHT", "tsn", "tsn_battle_cruiser", "behav_npcship")
    a2x_dir_throttle(dh_w, 270, 0.4)
    ->END

@map/heading_demo "DEMO dir_throttle headings"
" Watch four ships fan out from the centre; each label says which compass direction its 2.8
" heading should send it. Wrong direction -> flip the signs in a2x dir_throttle.
    await task_schedule(run_heading_demo)
